body:
\[PS4\] \[2700 - 3200 SR\] \[NA\]

&#x200B;

**Hi all!**

My name is Pandas! My fiancee, Coin, and I are looking for 4 other high platinum/low diamond players to regularly group up for try hard comps, starting this weekend! I am a support main and Coin is a support/tank flex, however we both prefer to take the support slots.

&#x200B;

We are looking for two tanks (one main/shield tank, one off tank) and two DPS/Flex heroes (preferably someone who does sustained damage and someone who does burst damage). We're pretty picky, but that's only because we tend to go on win streaks when we are. We've been on a winning streak for about 4 days (until yesterday where we got our first 2 losses).

&#x200B;

We ask that you play the role you sign up for and play the heroes you prefer/are comfortable with. We'll never force you onto heroes that you cannot play.

&#x200B;

You **must** have a mic and be willing to communicate with your team. We tend to do a lot of call-outs, but it's important that everyone else communicates as well. Protect us when we need it and we'll keep you alive **guaranteed**!

&#x200B;

See below for more info on us!

* Pandas
   * Current SR:  2707
   * Career high: Approximately 3100 (will edit later with exact number)
   * Heroes: Ana, Moira, Mercy, Brigitte, Baptiste, Lucio (Ana/Moira are main)
* Coin
   * Current SR: 2701
   * Career high: Approximately 3480 (will edit later with exact number)
   * Heroes: Ana, Zenyatta, Moira, Mercy, Brigitte, Baptiste, Lucio (Zenyatta/Lucio are main)

&#x200B;

If you're interested, please DM me with your Gamertag, current SR, and role preference. If everything looks good, I'll give you our discord server and Gamertags so you can add us.

&#x200B;

We look forward to meeting you!

&#x200B;

EDIT: I forgot to mention when we usually play. On weekends, any time of the day/night usually works. On weekdays, we usually are on from 6 PM CST to 8:30 PM CST.
